    "updated_at": "2019-02-22T11:25:49Z",
    "body": "I think we should allow the user agent to either give some kind of list or trigger the Action of the first, in that case.\r\n\r\nThe specification [does not currently require](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#the-accesskey-attribute) the values to be unique. Perhaps that needs updating too.\r\n\r\nAlso seems reasonable to ignore tree boundaries. Though if someone ever defines some kind of API on top of accesskey that would need careful auditing.",
